{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.10"
  description: "`N` stands in `array.max_items`, whose type is the kernel's `non_negative_integer`, and a written type on a value parameter narrows the type of the positions it stands in. `int8` resolves, and is no narrowing of `non_negative_integer`."
  meta: "meta.tn"
  import: ["core.tn"]
